profile_positions.description:
The marketing leader for multiple cross-industry services practices, including ERP, CRM, SCM, Microsoft, and Strategy.

Central figure in three global, multi-million dollar marketing initiatives during the period:
- Repositioned company for transformation with ‘brand re-launch’ (Oct ’05);
- Defined own market segment through launch of Global Visible Commerce (Oct ’04);
- Created competitive differentiator through unveiling of 3D Blueprinting (June ‘03).

Selected for two Unisys programs for top employees:  ‘Talent Review’ (top 1% of all employees) and the Marketing Leadership Program.

The corporate authority on competitive positioning, partnering, and M&A candidates.
• Researched ~500 companies in ~100 industry categories;
• Successfully managed integration of purchased companies for maximum benefit.

Marketing jack-of-all-trades at this industry-rattling experiment. 
• Spearheaded development of 20 market offerings utilizing leading technologies;
• Served as account exec for our largest client – met or exceeded all expectations
  -  ~40k+ seat installation made it world’s largest corporate ‘e-travel’ system at the time;
  -  NPV savings estimated at over $30 million.
• Oversaw successful negotiation and integration with a dozen+ partners.
